# problem #7, the other half: a focused game that finds no room is turned
# away as before (nobody's memory moves inside its allocation; vkd3d and GL
# drivers place by the budget and fall back by themselves).
cap 4000
proc 1614 kwin_wayland old
proc 700 pinned old never chunk=64
proc 5000 game chunk=64
act 1614 0 4
act 700 0 10
place 700 3000 0 0

hint 5000 f full launched
act 5000 0 30
target 5000 900 0.9
at 6
alloc 5000 192 n=3
at 10
expect denied 5000 >= 1
expect evicted 5000 == 0
